<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed">
<div style="font-weight:bold;line-height:2;">List of Extra Scaling Effects</div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content">
*The particles benefit from generic increases to weapon base damage, such as from {{Arcane|Arcane Arachne}}, {{M|Holster Amp}}, and {{M|Vigorous Swap}}, but not from weapon class specific increases like {{M|Steel Charge}} or {{M|Rifle Amp}}.
**The particles can also benefit from flat critical chance, such as from {{A|Covenant}} or {{Arcane|Arcane Avenger}}. However, they have a critical multiplier of 1x, so sources of critical damage like {{M|Tenacious Bond}} are required for any effect on the damage.
**Most elemental damage boosts, such as {{M|Shock Trooper}}, have no effect. 
**{{M|Valence Formation}} does apply both its effects. 
**{{A|Nourish}} applies both damage and {{D|Viral}} elemental weight that will compete with the innate {{D|Blast}} of the particles.
**{{A|Xata's Whisper}} damage buff applies as well as status effect
</div></div>
*'''Ability Synergy:''' With {{M|Molecular Fission}}, Null Stars will slow or speed up enemies based on the most recent type of hold or tap {{A|Molecular Prime}} cast.
**{{M|Molecular Fission}} will cause enemies hit by Null Stars upon death to recharge Null Stars.
*Subsuming Nova to the [[Helminth]] will offer Null Star and its augments to be used by other Warframes.
**Damage reduction caps at <u>'''75%'''</u> instead of 90%.
